{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend into the Abyss...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore fractured worlds shaped by ancient wars.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/283e763cb3ebc0732496f630d27dd9cc.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/283e763cb3ebc0732496f630d27dd9cc.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living World, Split by the Abyss</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical world layers are stacked beneath the surface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless travel between realms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden paths and ancient shortcuts waiting to be found</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/438e629afbde606f5d75a35961b86365.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/438e629afbde606f5d75a35961b86365.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/42eeae7ad12a31426c8c9235d9be42d6.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/42eeae7ad12a31426c8c9235d9be42d6.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/df5266694b9307ec05dc30f0483db259.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/df5266694b9307ec05dc30f0483db259.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/ca8f01733c8e7b122b618ad9e9847913.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/ca8f01733c8e7b122b618ad9e9847913.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face Creatures Born of Lost Worlds</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient beasts and corrupted guardians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each realm has its own ecosystem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some challenges are optional\u2026 and deadly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/0392ffdc7feb9fa8eba3b9b9cb5b9f85.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/0392ffdc7feb9fa8eba3b9b9cb5b9f85.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/0af3c93d48d3ce4be983efc8a2407c5e.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/0af3c93d48d3ce4be983efc8a2407c5e.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/5bebd3e5691f6705bcf5e134ea24dc45.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/5bebd3e5691f6705bcf5e134ea24dc45.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/abcc4ad4e7b78511b2300f202f8cd150.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/abcc4ad4e7b78511b2300f202f8cd150.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/dd5170045ae17119a167b14f4316e3e0.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/dd5170045ae17119a167b14f4316e3e0.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive, Adapt, Overcome</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mechanics tied to exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare before facing greater threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/d8cb9f0f4d06d1c77db99c191e68929e.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/d8cb9f0f4d06d1c77db99c191e68929e.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/47dfb9b2c3fd1c9ec9987de76b375abf.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/47dfb9b2c3fd1c9ec9987de76b375abf.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Shelter in the Abyss</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, gear, and furniture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your personal space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base grows as you do</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/ea6f89d064979d7cd1b23ed00af17df8.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/ea6f89d064979d7cd1b23ed00af17df8.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/69adb4b3b74415ee66c909f015e47417.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/69adb4b3b74415ee66c909f015e47417.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Slower Life Between Expeditions</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming and fishing systems. Peaceful moments\u2026 before the next descent</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/9f14bb92aa79322da1d63a5d5a8a718e.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/9f14bb92aa79322da1d63a5d5a8a718e.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/18668a8f797f433feb9a5fe21e90d4e1.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/18668a8f797f433feb9a5fe21e90d4e1.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tame Beasts. Ride Legends.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture and tame creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mounts with unique movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration changes with companions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/64c4369bc739b9d32159fc21c7391c4a.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/64c4369bc739b9d32159fc21c7391c4a.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/84b6ebf03ccc8fddfcefe27b9a67634f.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/84b6ebf03ccc8fddfcefe27b9a67634f.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Path</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way through the Abyss</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/d81e7d9ac72f4b63fe781ddfa71c7a92.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/d81e7d9ac72f4b63fe781ddfa71c7a92.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;The Abyss was not meant to exist. Something ancient still sleeps beneath its deepest layer.&quot; - Unnamed Explorer.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/faa9c106640c4244deb1d0398df13930547878fe.jpg"},{"name":"From Nothing to Something","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/0595758d2ca4600161875a9ebf1bbfce3c944e89.jpg"},{"name":"Arm Yourself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/71fb453b6ad61e38bff0e7400928913c65e522db.jpg"},{"name":"Embers of a New Dawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/be9cf731260f0ad502b009ec72ddb6cebfde8854.jpg"},{"name":"Through the First Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/169786982ea869268702b04c31cdd5019602ef1a.jpg"},{"name":"First Spark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/6f76ba78ac50964cc15634f0e24ec251662763ea.jpg"},{"name":"The Forgotten Verse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/d578097b219698e83c1b6bf018ca5fcf61979d9f.jpg"},{"name":"Abyss-Woken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/e543b240eee32c3ac7a567eb341794f6a0fe5551.jpg"},{"name":"First Echo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/67ce386832fde520a77586007e55f34c649d808c.jpg"},{"name":"Symphony of Revelation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2747280/16af5daee0cae485bcde3c0d07f2c4f491d283af.jpg"}],"total":77},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2747280?t=1772684621","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/064ede147979ab6a4db31b4f07c1714407d70e21/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772684621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/0c080e049334b8fe32f08533861015e116518048/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772684621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/0c080e049334b8fe32f08533861015e116518048/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772684621","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abyss: New Dawn \u2013 Roadmap Toward Version 1.0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As we move closer to the full 1.0 release of <strong>Abyss: New Dawn</strong>, we want to clearly share our current development focus and priorities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal for 1.0 is not to endlessly expand, but to <strong>deliver a complete, stable, and meaningful experience</strong> for those who choose to stay in the world of Abyss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Phase 1 \u2013 Stability &amp; Core Polish</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix high-priority bugs reported during Early Access</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve performance, loading times, and overall stability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polish core systems such as crafting, inventory, and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebalance early-game pacing to make the experience smoother and more approachable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal:</strong> A stable and frustration-free foundation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Phase 2 \u2013 World &amp; Progression Refinement</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clarify the core gameplay loop: survive \u2192 build \u2192 expand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce unnecessary grind and improve progression flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance environmental storytelling and quest pacing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal:</strong> Help players better understand what they are building toward, and why the world matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Phase 3 \u2013 Content Completion for 1.0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the planned core content for the 1.0 experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refine and streamline existing systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid adding large new features outside the original vision</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal:</strong> A cohesive and finished experience, not an unfinished sandbox.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Phase 4 \u2013 Quality of Life &amp; Community Feedback</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quality-of-life improvements based on player feedback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI/UX and readability enhancements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smaller but consistent updates focused on real play experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal:</strong> Support and respect the players who continue the journey with us.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Important Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This roadmap reflects our current development direction toward version 1.0.<br>Details may change as we continue refining the game based on player feedback and testing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who has supported <strong>Abyss: New Dawn</strong> and helped shape its future.</p></p><br><h1>The Winter Holiday Event is Live! \u2744\ufe0f</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hello Abyss Explorers,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Winter Holiday Event has arrived in Abyss: New Dawn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a limited time, a brand-new winter-themed event world has opened its gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This snowy region is separate from the main worlds and was created especially for the holiday season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf84 What awaits you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique Winter Event Boss to challenge</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Festive rewards, including a Winter Outfit Set</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short seasonal adventure to enjoy between your expeditions into the Abyss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The event will be available for a limited time, so be sure to jump in before it fades with the season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Happy holidays, Explorers! \u2744\ufe0f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/0b5c780aef5600cc36a8be8af367b960.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/0b5c780aef5600cc36a8be8af367b960.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/c1185f9cdc3a9e36afb14ab5943a5e0a.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/c1185f9cdc3a9e36afb14ab5943a5e0a.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend into the Abyss...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore fractured worlds shaped by ancient wars.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/283e763cb3ebc0732496f630d27dd9cc.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/283e763cb3ebc0732496f630d27dd9cc.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living World, Split by the Abyss</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical world layers are stacked beneath the surface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless travel between realms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden paths and ancient shortcuts waiting to be found</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/438e629afbde606f5d75a35961b86365.poster.avif?t=1772684621\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747280/extras/438e629afbde606f5d75a35961b86365.webm?t=1772684621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>